      {
        "id": 20872,
        "name": "WriterRyan",
        "username": "WriterRyan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-09T12:48:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The latter interpretation is correct. Non-environment targets are hero targets and villain targets, so everything except the environment cards with HP.</p>",
